# Git and delivery workflow

**Default (local manual Cursor):** Do not create branches, commit, push, or open pull requests unless the user **explicitly asks**. See [docs/MANUAL_DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md](../../docs/MANUAL_DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md).

**Cursor Cloud Agent / Linear-delegated tasks:** Follow [docs/CLOUD_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md](../../docs/CLOUD_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md) — separate branch, commit, push, PR, verification handoff, no auto-merge.

If mode is unclear, assume **manual** (no git actions) unless the user or task description clearly indicates Cloud Agent / Linear delegation.
